<td>Covert Operations</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h2 id="toc2"><span><span style="font-size:80%;">House Connection</span></span></h2>
<p>As an agent of your house, you can always get food and lodging for yourself and your friends at a house enclave. When the house assigns you a mission, it will usually provide you with the necessary supplies and transportation. Beyond this, you have many old friends, mentors, and rivals in your house, and you may encounter one of them when you interact with a house business. The degree to which such acquaintances are willing to help you depends on your current standing in your house.</p>
<h1 id="toc3"><span><span style="font-size:80%;">Suggested Characteristics</span></span></h1>
<p>House agents are diverse. Consider the house you serve and the work you do when choosing characteristics.</p>
<div class="feature">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-sm-6">
<h2 id="toc4"><span><span style="font-size:80%;">Personality Traits</span></span></h2>
<table class="wiki-content-table">
<tr>
<th>d6</th>
<th>Personality Trait</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>1</td>
<td>I'm always looking to improve efficiency.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>2</td>
<td>I love to share trivia about my house's business.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>3</td>
<td>I never forget an insult against me or my house.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>4</td>
<td>I'm enthusiastic about everything my house does.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>5</td>
<td>I represent my house and take pride in my looks.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>6</td>
<td>I'm critical of monarchies and limits on the houses.</td>
</tr>
</table>
</div>
<div class="col-sm-6">
<h2 id="toc5"><span><span style="font-size:80%;">Ideals</span></span></h2>
<table class="wiki-content-table">
<tr>
<th>d6</th>
<th>Ideal</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>1</td>
<td><strong>Common Good.</strong> My house serves a vital function, and its prosperity will help everyone. (Good)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>2</td>
<td><strong>Tradition.</strong> I uphold traditions of my house and bring honor to my family. (Lawful)</td>
</tr>
